    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he wakes up, he finds himself in an escape pod. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has no memory, doesn't know where he is, and can't even remember his own name.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/f1e576b47f131d5fd456a9e34319cc8f.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/f1e576b47f131d5fd456a9e34319cc8f.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/f1e576b47f131d5fd456a9e34319cc8f.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He arrives at a shopping street but there is no one there. Only a robot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/4c043b3b4705c38f44b9444fe35724a3.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=640 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/4c043b3b4705c38f44b9444fe35724a3.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/4c043b3b4705c38f44b9444fe35724a3.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The robot speaks to him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;You have temporarily lost your memory. If you want to regain your memory quickly, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you should go to the museum and look around at various things.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With nowhere to go, he decides to head to the museum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Obtain a secretary hidden somewhere and learn and strengthen command skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0 It can also be learned at a dojo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/9709072960ccba16c677654d6ef3fb74.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/9709072960ccba16c677654d6ef3fb74.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/9709072960ccba16c677654d6ef3fb74.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/d153f0aaa463cd31caf181213a230d8c.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/d153f0aaa463cd31caf181213a230d8c.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/d153f0aaa463cd31caf181213a230d8c.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/8fd2a619ea2b4e6aa35a1fcc913b17a0.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=256 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/8fd2a619ea2b4e6aa35a1fcc913b17a0.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/8fd2a619ea2b4e6aa35a1fcc913b17a0.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/aa920a3420ddc921691027af17da0c35.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=592 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/aa920a3420ddc921691027af17da0c35.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/aa920a3420ddc921691027af17da0c35.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/d1b5b46eb613417840a5de3e70f4e782.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=368 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/d1b5b46eb613417840a5de3e70f4e782.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/d1b5b46eb613417840a5de3e70f4e782.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/0108eaeeaa702e43167f30ff323272fd.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=512 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/0108eaeeaa702e43167f30ff323272fd.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/0108eaeeaa702e43167f30ff323272fd.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Enemies have attributes, and each has their own resistances and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons and command skills also have attributes, so you can change weapons depending on the enemy or use command skills to exploit their weak points when fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Filiy Friends are somewhere, so find them and make them your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filiy Friends' abilities will expand the places you can explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/8c6dce3a73c7450561a385e9df5ef4c6.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/8c6dce3a73c7450561a385e9df5ef4c6.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfExplore this star and find out why everyone has disappeared.</p>",
