tore_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/0108eaeeaa702e43167f30ff323272fd.mp4?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Enemies have attributes, and each has their own resistances and weaknesses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons and command skills also have attributes, so you can change weapons depending on the enemy or use command skills to exploit their weak points when fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Filiy Friends are somewhere, so find them and make them your allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Filiy Friends' abilities will expand the places you can explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/8c6dce3a73c7450561a385e9df5ef4c6.poster.avif?t=1750645320\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533360/extras/8c6dce3a73c7450561a385e9df5ef4c6.webm?t=1750645320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cfExplore this star and find out why everyone has disappeared.</p>",
